        "line": 73,
        "column": 1,
        "offset": 1494
      },
      "text": "/// Anything that can be stored.\npub trait Storable: fmt::Debug + Clone {\n    /// The encoded form.\n    type Encoded;\n\n    /// The version this kind starts at.\n    const START: u64 = 1;\n\n    /// Encodes the value.\n    fn encode(\u0026self) -\u003e Self::Encoded;\n\n    /// Reports the size in bytes.\n    fn size(\u0026self) -\u003e usize {\n        std::mem::size_of_val(self)\n    }\n}",
      "hash": "535f82244286c040c6e035bc512a485bcc0314bb597556a0caaa8d24a8123231"
    },
    {
      "id": "L75#1",
