      },
      "text": "/// Opens a store with a capacity.\npub async fn open\u003cV\u003e(capacity: usize) -\u003e Result\u003cStore\u003cV\u003e, error::Error\u003e\nwhere\n    V: Storable + Send,\n{\n    let cap = util::clamp(capacity);\n    storage::reserve(cap).await?;\n    Ok(Store::new())\n}",
